1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,555
My homeland...

2
00:00:06,555 --> 00:00:09,000
My homeland!

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Glory and beauty,

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
sublimity and splendor

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
are in your hills...

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Are in your hills!

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Life and deliverance,

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,900
pleasure and hope

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,000
are in your air...

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Are in your air!

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,800
Will I see you, will I see you?

12
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:35,000
Safely comforted and victoriously honored...

13
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Safely comforted and victoriously honored!

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,555
Will I see you?

15
00:00:41,555 --> 00:00:44,000
In your eminence?

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Reaching to the stars...

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Reaching to the stars!

18
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
My homeland...

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
My homeland.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
My homeland, my homeland!

21
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
The youth will not tire, 'till your independence.

22
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Or they die...

23
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Or they die!

24
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
We will drink from death, and will not be to our enemies

25
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
like slaves, like slaves.

26
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:19,000
We do not want, we do not want:

27
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
An eternal humiliation, nor a miserable life...

28
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
An eternal humiliation,

29
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
nor a miserable life.

30
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
We do not want,

31
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
but we will bring back:

32
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Our storied glory...

33
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Our storied glory!

34
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
My homeland...

35
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,200
My homeland!